  "reviewFindings": [
    "Complete candidate UI dispatch/Check/claim/perform paths and all new store methods reviewed. Exact original creator, intent bytes and actual lease generation retained after durable caller save and before attach. No selected URL or raw receipt is persisted.",
    "Verified production transition on immutable9b: existing root lifetime drain then application close; workspace owner awaits session revokeAndDrain then actual journal close; serialized connect reopens original protected journal before publishing current creator/session. Generation UUID is unique, lifetime state monotonic; actor inequality alone is not claimed as evidence.",
